Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.46,0:00:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, please!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.38,0:00:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Liliel's photographer!\NI just want to talk!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.13,0:00:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would that be okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.92,0:02:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can hold it for you if you want.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.54,0:02:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's the guy from the store!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.75,0:02:10.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.46,0:02:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.25,0:02:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Suddenly getting approached by some\Nrandom guy probably freaked you out!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.04,0:02:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not really good at talking to new people.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.79,0:02:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had to work up the courage to catch you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.83,0:02:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Other people need to work up the\Ncourage to talk to people, too?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.75,0:02:37.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.63,0:02:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to believe all cosplayers are friends and allies.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.21,0:02:44.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-how do you feel about Liliel?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.92,0:02:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love her! I love her so much!\NI want to be her friend!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.54,0:02:54.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.96,0:02:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you don't like her.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.21,0:03:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,When that ranking came out,\NI was kind of annoyed about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.63,0:03:07.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, my Liliel deserves to be number one.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.58,0:03:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I ranked higher!\NShe's way more adorable than me!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.13,0:03:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know cosplay's not a competition,\Nand the ranking doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.25,0:03:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should just be happy that Liliel's having fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.75,0:03:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I still feel weird about it,\Nand I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.58,0:03:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you feel the same way?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.50,0:03:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Were you annoyed to get fourth?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.96,0:03:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you think Liliel's your\Nrival and aren't a fan of her,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.33,0:03:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,could you tell me why you feel that way?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.79,0:03:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think it'd help me figure out how to feel, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.25,0:03:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's taking this so seriously.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.50,0:03:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But oh, god, he's got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.29,0:03:47.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay if you don't like her.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.00,0:03:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Real otaku don't judge someone\Nfor what they like or don't like.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They don't judge...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.38,0:03:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some cosplayers want to try\Nand be better than other cosplayers,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and that's totally fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.75,0:04:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that's why you don't like Liliel,\NI'm totally okay with that.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.67,0:04:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just want to understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.63,0:04:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He wants to understand?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.58,0:04:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He wants to know what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.13,0:04:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's taking this so seriously...\NIt's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yet I don't feel uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.17,0:04:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like he'd listen to what I have to say.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.38,0:04:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.88,0:04:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't get my voice to work.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you talking is hard for you, I can wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.21,0:04:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I'm not bothering you, I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.38,0:04:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll even turn the other way.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.13,0:05:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,How long have we been here?\NFive, ten minutes?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.25,0:05:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's seriously going to wait?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm breathing calmly again.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.75,0:05:30.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.54,0:05:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you... for helping me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.08,0:05:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I spoke!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.88,0:05:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He didn't want me to say that!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.83,0:05:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm being weird again!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.04,0:05:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.08,0:06:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He... responded to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.38,0:06:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.08,0:06:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Smile!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.67,0:06:20.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does Nonoa-chan really hate me?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.29,0:06:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then if she had fans here,\Nwould they hate me too?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.50,0:06:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't they hate me for bringing\NLiliel to a Cinderella Stars event?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.96,0:06:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The more I think,\Nthe more I feel like everyone hates me!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.17,0:06:46.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I need to take a break!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.29,0:06:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sensei.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.29,0:06:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You okay? You're totally out of it today.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.17,0:06:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.54,0:07:03.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't look like you're enjoying this at all!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.25,0:07:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I put too much pressure on you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.79,0:07:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, you didn't put any pressure on me at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,At least feel a little, sheesh.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.00,0:07:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're worried about Nonoa,\Nand if she likes you or not.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.63,0:07:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why're you so worked up about that?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.00,0:07:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who cares if someone doesn't like you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.46,0:07:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me! I've moved on from that.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.79,0:07:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, Liliel...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.67,0:07:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know I just figured this out,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.54,0:07:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I'm the last person who\Nshould be lecturing you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.50,0:07:43.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love all cosplayers.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.17,0:07:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean that\Neveryone has to like me, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.17,0:07:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's entitled to their own opinions.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.50,0:07:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,As much as I want everyone to like me,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.46,0:07:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't control how they feel about me.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.96,0:08:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have psychic powers.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.25,0:08:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't move rocks with my mind,\Nor manpiulate someone's thoughts.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.17,0:08:09.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,So if someone doesn't like me,\NI should just accept it?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.83,0:08:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.96,0:08:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm saying you shouldn't waste your time\Nwondering if someone likes you or not.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.96,0:08:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what other people think.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What matters is what you think.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.63,0:08:23.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the only thing that should matter to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.67,0:08:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think of her, Liliel?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.67,0:08:32.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you don't like her,\Nyou don't have to be her friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.92,0:08:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just ignore her.\NYou're entitled to your opinion, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.92,0:08:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to be her friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.08,0:08:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, cosplayers all love the same thing!\NWe're all on the same team!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.46,0:08:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I totally agree.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.38,0:08:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So go get her!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.25,0:08:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you tell her how you feel,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.54,0:09:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,you might just change the\Nway she feels about you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.33,0:09:03.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right! Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I said something.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.96,0:09:16.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I finally told someone how I feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.71,0:09:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.04,0:09:22.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to tell her, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,She probably hates me,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.83,0:09:28.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I don't want this misunderstanding\Nto go on any longer!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.71,0:09:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't even ask to be friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.54,0:09:35.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just need a chance to tell her how I feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to make sure Liliel-chan hears that!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.04,0:09:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.92,0:09:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay if she hates me.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.83,0:09:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love her.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.92,0:09:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need her to know!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.25,0:09:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.21,0:09:56.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, where have you been?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.83,0:09:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's Ririsa?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.88,0:10:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She went to go look for Nonoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's not a bad person.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.21,0:10:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's just a little awkward.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.00,0:10:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa will understand!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.71,0:10:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,C-can we get some pictures of you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.29,0:10:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.08,0:10:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm in a hurry!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-is that a no?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.83,0:10:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, Nonoa-chan doesn't talk\Ncause she's in character!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.71,0:10:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then she means yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.88,0:10:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.96,0:10:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That terrifying glare that\Nmakes your blood run cold!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.58,0:10:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The perfect Coulia impression!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.71,0:10:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's almost a little too scary...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.63,0:10:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-thank you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.25,0:10:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening to me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan's doing photos now!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,For real?! Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.38,0:10:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,How long is this gonna take?! Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.96,0:11:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,At 1 PM, we'll have our Rock-Paper-Scissors\Ntournament at the main stage!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.08,0:11:05.13,Q5,,0,0,0,,To prep for the tournament,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.13,0:11:07.42,Q5,,0,0,0,,our photo areas will close at 12:30. Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.42,0:11:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Already?! That's in thirty minutes!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.42,0:11:09.04,Q6,,0,0,0,,our photo areas will close at 12:30. Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.04,0:11:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Already?! That's in thirty minutes!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.08,0:11:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I guess this event is about\Nmore than just cosplay...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.63,0:11:15.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, there's Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.42,0:11:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We saw you on Mr. Camera's blog!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're huge fans!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.50,0:11:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! T-thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.67,0:11:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have fans? I could cry!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.79,0:11:29.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I have to go find Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.92,0:11:33.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, could we get a picture of you?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.38,0:11:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We heard you were here and\Nhave been looking all over for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.42,0:11:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's only thirty minutes left!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I can't tell them no...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.71,0:11:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if I let them take pictures,\NI won't be able to catch Nonoa-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.08,0:11:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.21,0:11:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.42,0:11:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's really her!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.96,0:12:02.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, am I interrupting?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.67,0:12:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.75,0:12:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, both of them are here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,She posted a picture with her before.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.42,0:12:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, but could I take pictures here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.21,0:12:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nowhere else can handle my crowd.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.25,0:12:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, of course!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.71,0:12:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry to interrupt!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.54,0:12:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, no, you're good!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.13,0:12:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Nagomi-chan is talking to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.46,0:12:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You two can cut straight to the front of the line.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.63,0:12:32.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The front of the line...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,...for a Heavenly Queen?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.75,0:12:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.08,0:12:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.83,0:12:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.63,0:12:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.92,0:12:43.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm... Good with Nagomi-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.71,0:12:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! Dude!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.33,0:12:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why am I always like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.92,0:12:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should just tell people how I feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.08,0:12:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'd all be better off...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.13,0:13:02.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.17,0:13:04.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.29,0:13:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.54,0:13:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Both Rising Stars...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.75,0:13:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Sorry! Really sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.46,0:13:11.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Sorry! Really sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.46,0:13:11.79,Q8,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.58,0:13:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you take pictures with me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.46,0:13:22.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're both here!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.13,0:13:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.17,0:13:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't Nonoa-chan just ghost her?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.67,0:13:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't Nonoa-chan just ghost her?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.67,0:13:26.58,Q8,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.58,0:13:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did she?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.92,0:13:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,After what I did to her...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.88,0:13:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She still...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.17,0:13:38.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Say something.\NThis time, I have to say something!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.92,0:13:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-my voice worked fine before!\NAll I have to say is 'yes'!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just have to nod!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.25,0:13:52.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the thought of talking to someone\NI like so much is terrifying...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.54,0:13:55.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does she not like me?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.63,0:13:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I bothering her?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.13,0:13:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm being awkward.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.83,0:14:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She told me no before.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.17,0:14:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What matters is what you think.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.38,0:14:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.92,0:14:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She might not like me,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.21,0:14:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I want to believe that all cosplayers are allies,\Nare my friends!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.42,0:14:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter what you might think of me,\NI still want to cosplay with you!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's an angel...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.21,0:14:47.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Descending from heaven to take the stage, Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.08,0:14:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's Liliel...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's here, in real life!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.04,0:15:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who am I, then?\NWho's the girl standing next to her?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.83,0:15:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,S...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.54,0:15:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sparkling like transparent ice,\NCobalt Blue, the seventh Cinderella...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.38,0:15:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Coulia!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.92,0:15:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,She spoke!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.25,0:15:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.46,0:15:33.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're ready for pictures now!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.29,0:15:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,The two most talked-about\Ncosplayers are here, together!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.33,0:15:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're at this event!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.54,0:15:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I came!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.88,0:15:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next, let's do the pose from their Second Live!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.42,0:15:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's Coulia's debut scene!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.92,0:15:51.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love that part!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.50,0:15:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.46,0:16:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Half an hour ago,\Nshe was worried sick about Nonoa not liking her.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.88,0:16:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,They grow up so fast.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.54,0:16:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm gonna snap some pics.\NHold my stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.79,0:16:09.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, I thought I was the photographer here!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.71,0:16:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've only got ten minutes left!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.17,0:16:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going in, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.46,0:16:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.25,0:16:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the pose from the album art\Nfor my song, Angels Up!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.21,0:16:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if I can't speak,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.67,0:16:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can communicate with my love for the game,\Nwith cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Liliel-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.00,0:16:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It feels like I've finally made a friend!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.79,0:16:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look over here!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.83,0:16:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry for dragging you into my shoot.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.17,0:16:52.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just really wanted to get pictures with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.83,0:17:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...\NEven now, I still can't speak.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.46,0:17:07.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've gotta go. Thanks again.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.42,0:17:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, you sure you don't want\Nto get her number or anything?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.58,0:17:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would, but I've already bothered her enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.21,0:17:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't change how Nonoa-chan feels.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.83,0:17:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told her how I feel,\Nand I don't want to keep pushing that on her.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.46,0:17:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I said my piece.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.25,0:17:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's entitled to her own feelings about me.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.29,0:17:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.50,0:17:49.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.79,0:17:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan already has lots of friends.\NShe doesn't need me.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.75,0:18:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got to live the dream for a moment.\NThat's enough for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But is it, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.13,0:18:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't I come here to make friends with her?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.96,0:18:10.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right. This can't be it.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.63,0:18:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not okay with things ending like this!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.96,0:18:19.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't make friends. I'm fine being alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.75,0:18:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel-chan is a good person.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.88,0:18:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,She was just being nice to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.08,0:18:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way she'd actually\Nwant to be friends with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.21,0:18:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that me?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.58,0:18:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't get excited just because\Nsomeone was nice to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.08,0:18:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll just end up bothering her.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.29,0:18:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll embarrass myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.42,0:18:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.13,0:18:41.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.13,0:18:42.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop it, shut up!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.71,0:18:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is easier.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.33,0:18:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.71,0:18:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I speak,\NI just end up making things worse.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.67,0:18:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I try to involve myself with other people,\NI just end up getting hurt.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.75,0:18:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop it, stop it!\NWhy are you saying this?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.08,0:18:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because everyone would be\Nbetter off if I didn't speak.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.42,0:19:02.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.04,0:19:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the person I turned myself into.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.25,0:19:09.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,The person I became after years of overthinking.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.96,0:19:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll always be alone.\NNo one will ever want me.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.58,0:19:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't have friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.21,0:19:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to make friends.\NI'll be alone forever.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.79,0:19:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop it. You're not me!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.25,0:19:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Nonoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.88,0:19:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.33,0:19:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the person I was,\Nuntil yesterday!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.38,0:19:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't stay the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.83,0:19:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I found the strength to speak.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.29,0:19:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told someone how I feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.75,0:19:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I connected with someone I like!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.88,0:19:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.04,0:19:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was Coulia.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.00,0:19:52.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was just playing make-believe.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who cares?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.92,0:19:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can become someone I'm not!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.50,0:20:02.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That means I can be someone different today!\NA new me!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can change.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.25,0:20:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to change!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.29,0:20:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.54,0:20:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.79,0:20:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you be my friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.13,0:20:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes! Of course I'll be your friend!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.25,0:20:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can change.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.63,0:20:54.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder if my past self would believe me...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.63,0:20:54.75,Q6,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.75,0:20:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder if my past self would believe me...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.67,0:21:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,...if I told her my first friend\Nwould be the angel I loved so dearly.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.58,0:21:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's great, Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.75,0:21:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Turn a little to the side for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.42,0:21:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I remember right,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.42,0:21:10.71,Q6,,0,0,0,,That's it! Perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.71,0:21:11.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai was going to some event with everyone today.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.71,0:21:11.33,Q6,,0,0,0,,That's it! Perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.33,0:21:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai was going to some event with everyone today.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.88,0:21:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something soon, then...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.33,0:21:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that serious expression is great!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.63,0:21:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, focus!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.96,0:21:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If my plan to win Senpai's heart by becoming
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.96,0:21:23.92,Q6,,0,0,0,,Yes, perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.92,0:21:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If my plan to win Senpai's heart by becoming
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.00,0:21:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,a famous model didn't work out,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.00,0:21:26.00,Q6,,0,0,0,,Now look at me!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.00,0:21:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,a famous model didn't work out,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.21,0:21:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,then I'm just going to have to\Ngo with the cosplay plan after all!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.29,0:21:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's a wrap!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.17,0:21:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.88,0:21:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could I borrow you for that interview now?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.71,0:21:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.38,0:21:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.58,0:21:43.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Going straight to the CEO won't help.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.67,0:21:48.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay just wouldn't\Nwork with our agency's strategy.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.88,0:21:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's crazy to believe you were\Nonce extremely shy, Mikari-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.42,0:21:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, but once I've got\Nmy mind set on something,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.17,0:21:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just go after it, you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.88,0:21:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I will.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.33,0:22:03.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you like to do on your days off?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.13,0:22:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be strategic about this!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.17,0:22:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love to cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.42,0:22:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay? Wow.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.92,0:22:12.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm super into it!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.54,0:22:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about putting some of\Nmy cosplay pics up on my social media!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.46,0:22:19.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,When was she going to tell me this?!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.67,0:22:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:54.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,403.2)}{\an7}Together With You
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:19.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,57.6)}{\an7}RUMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:26.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,86.4)}{\an7}PANIC PANIC
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:28.46,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,86.4)}{\an7}RRRRUMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:54.21,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,280.8)}{\an7}Cinderella Stars
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:15.21,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,57.6)}{\an7}GLARE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:24:00.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,388.8)}{\an7}I'll Keep Evolving
